00:00:51.739 --> 00:00:53.039
- I would just call the person OK.

00:00:53.039 --> 00:00:54.583
- [Voiceover] Kim Jong-Hyun.

00:00:54.583 --> 00:00:55.967
- I would have said Shin-Ee.

00:00:55.967 --> 00:00:56.890
