00:01:42.626 --> 00:01:43.804
Kim Heechul.

00:01:43.804 --> 00:01:44.637
- Kim-EE-Choo.

00:01:44.637 --> 00:01:45.734
Chool.

00:01:45.734 --> 00:01:47.725
That's the hardest thing
I've ever heard in my life.

00:01:47.725 --> 00:01:49.533
