bae as in like my bae.

00:01:58.153 --> 00:01:59.728
Beh, beh, beh.

00:01:59.728 --> 00:02:02.456
Let's try this slower. Bae-Sooh-Ji

00:02:02.456 --> 00:02:03.252
I think that was good.

00:02:03.252 --> 00:02:05.119
