it's not pretty good though.

00:02:05.119 --> 00:02:06.300
- [Voiceover] Kwon Ji Yong.

00:02:06.300 --> 00:02:07.560
- [Man] G-Dragon.

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:09.306
