guy, he's pretty popular.

00:02:09.306 --> 00:02:10.506
- Kwon Ji Yong.

00:02:10.506 --> 00:02:11.684
Yong, Yong.

00:02:11.684 --> 00:02:12.497
- Kwon Ji Yong.

00:02:12.497 --> 00:02:14.203
- Oh yeah, the oh, oh.

00:02:14.203 --> 00:02:15.016
- Yong.

